WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.345 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WEB NOVEL
<i>THE EARLY SPRING</i>, BY GU NIANG BIE KU

01:42.905 --> 01:43.945
Where were you?

01:45.625 --> 01:46.705
I went to make a call.

01:47.665 --> 01:48.985
Sun Yu.

01:49.665 --> 01:50.705
Wake up.

01:51.505 --> 01:52.505
One more round!

01:53.225 --> 01:54.345
One more?

01:58.225 --> 01:59.065
Where's Yao Bei?

01:59.145 --> 02:01.025
She said she wanted to head back
to pack her luggage.

02:01.105 --> 02:02.025
Then, she left.

02:03.385 --> 02:04.305
Right.

02:05.145 --> 02:06.345
She got promoted.

02:06.425 --> 02:08.225
She's going to Hong Kong, China.

02:08.825 --> 02:09.985
-Promoted?
-She's leaving Beijing.

02:11.385 --> 02:13.705
I almost forgot to tell you this.

02:13.785 --> 02:14.785
I got promoted too.

02:16.065 --> 02:18.145
Don't tell me you're leaving Beijing too.

02:18.225 --> 02:19.465
No.

02:19.545 --> 02:20.705
No way.

02:20.785 --> 02:22.745
I'm not leaving until I get
a three-bedroom, one-living-room flat

02:22.825 --> 02:23.705
in Beijing.

02:24.305 --> 02:25.905
Don't leave.

02:25.985 --> 02:28.465
-No.
-None of you can leave Beijing.

02:28.545 --> 02:30.785
If you leave, no one will keep me company.

02:30.865 --> 02:32.225
Don't worry.

02:32.305 --> 02:34.505
I won't leave. I'll grow old with you.

02:34.585 --> 02:36.545
Pinky promise. None of you can leave.

02:36.625 --> 02:41.225
We'll stay in Beijing
and make our dreams come true.

02:42.745 --> 02:44.945
Make our dreams come true together.

02:46.505 --> 02:47.465
Don't go.

02:48.745 --> 02:49.785
Yes.

02:50.745 --> 02:51.905
Already passing out?

02:52.425 --> 02:53.985
Come on. You guys are boring.

02:54.065 --> 02:56.705
I'm just getting started,
and you guys are out cold.

02:57.745 --> 02:58.945
Lumi.

02:59.665 --> 03:00.945
Do you have a boyfriend?

03:01.745 --> 03:03.105
So many of them.

03:03.185 --> 03:05.145
I'm sure you can have more.

03:05.225 --> 03:06.625
We have a blind date event tomorrow.

03:06.705 --> 03:07.545
Come check it out.

03:07.625 --> 03:09.145
You can get any guy you want.

03:09.865 --> 03:11.185
I want one who looks like Eddie Peng.

03:11.265 --> 03:13.625
Eddie Peng?

03:13.705 --> 03:15.505
You might have encountered
a pig-butchering scam.

03:15.585 --> 03:16.825
You don't have a guy like that?

03:18.025 --> 03:20.065
Why bother mentioning it then?

03:20.985 --> 03:23.545
BEING WITH YOU IS LIKE A LEAP OF FAITH

03:28.385 --> 03:29.305
Morning.

03:29.385 --> 03:30.625
Morning, Tao.

03:30.705 --> 03:31.545
Morning.

03:32.545 --> 03:34.025
You're so early today.

03:35.625 --> 03:36.905
-Morning.
-Morning, Lumi.

03:40.865 --> 03:42.705
You're back in full force.

03:42.785 --> 03:44.345
You even put on red lipstick.

03:44.425 --> 03:45.625
We partied until so late last night,

03:45.705 --> 03:48.145
I almost couldn't wake up this morning.

03:49.465 --> 03:52.025
I agreed to be there for Sun Yu's event,

03:52.105 --> 03:53.385
so I dressed up a bit.

03:54.665 --> 03:56.665
Oh, the girl with the red sweater?
The matchmaker?

03:56.745 --> 03:57.585
Yes.

03:58.705 --> 04:00.425
Don't go to her matchmaking event.

04:00.505 --> 04:02.265
Why not meet up
with my childhood friend first?

04:03.425 --> 04:05.825
I'm just there to show support,
not for the blind date.

04:05.905 --> 04:07.785
When you're there this evening,

04:07.865 --> 04:08.945
check out the guys for me.

04:09.025 --> 04:11.585
See if there's someone like Eddie Peng,

04:12.185 --> 04:13.505
like what your friend said.

04:13.585 --> 04:15.625
If you find one, keep him for me.

04:15.705 --> 04:16.545
Sure.

04:18.624 --> 04:20.064
-Morning, Mr. Luan.
-Boss.

04:27.825 --> 04:29.025
Morning, Luke.

04:31.625 --> 04:32.745
Luan Nian.

04:33.265 --> 04:34.785
I want to hold onto you.

04:59.385 --> 05:01.025
LUKE: LUMI, COME TO MY OFFICE

05:04.105 --> 05:05.145
Come in.

05:06.865 --> 05:08.825
Boss. How can I help?

05:08.905 --> 05:11.665
How is the progress of the proposal
that you and Shang Zhitao are working on?

05:11.745 --> 05:12.865
I told her to submit it tomorrow.

05:12.945 --> 05:13.825
She has a blind date today.

05:14.985 --> 05:16.025
A blind date?

05:16.105 --> 05:19.185
Yes. She can't work overtime
every day, can she?

05:20.065 --> 05:23.185
We must all live our lives. Right, boss?

05:25.865 --> 05:27.105
Do you know why you work overtime?

05:27.785 --> 05:29.585
Because you don't focus on work
during office hours.

05:29.665 --> 05:31.145
I need the proposal today.

05:55.945 --> 05:57.105
Luke.

05:58.585 --> 05:59.505
Come with me.

06:01.185 --> 06:02.145
My work is done.

06:02.225 --> 06:03.305
Overtime.

06:04.385 --> 06:05.425
You want the proposal?

06:05.505 --> 06:06.865
I already sent it to Lumi.

06:06.945 --> 06:09.305
There is something else. Come.

06:26.305 --> 06:28.625
The seat belt is stuck.

06:54.905 --> 06:55.905
Thank you.

06:56.465 --> 06:57.625
Have you gotten the driving license?

06:59.065 --> 07:00.385
I got it last month.

07:02.785 --> 07:03.625
I'll take you to practice driving.

07:09.305 --> 07:10.945
You will participate in Yueteng's
new car test drive event.

07:13.825 --> 07:16.745
So by working overtime,
you mean I need to practice my driving?

07:17.345 --> 07:19.345
I mean I'm working overtime
to practice with you.

07:28.385 --> 07:30.105
<i>Sorry, I can't be there.</i>

07:30.185 --> 07:31.945
<i>Emergency overtime.</i>

07:56.265 --> 07:58.425
Take the wheel. I'll sit next to you.

07:59.585 --> 08:00.705
Practice with your car?

08:00.785 --> 08:02.065
Don't you have a driving license?

08:23.265 --> 08:24.465
Pull your seat forward.

08:34.865 --> 08:35.705
Practice.

08:45.705 --> 08:46.545
Go now.

08:57.225 --> 08:58.305
You were so eager to leave work today.

08:58.385 --> 08:59.905
Who were you planning to see?

09:02.385 --> 09:03.385
My flatmate.

09:03.465 --> 09:04.905
You have a blind date with your flatmate?

09:19.345 --> 09:21.025
Just how did you get your driving license?

09:22.345 --> 09:23.825
Let me go out and check.

09:23.905 --> 09:24.785
No need.

09:25.505 --> 09:26.865
I'll drive.

09:49.345 --> 09:50.465
Sorry.

09:52.945 --> 09:54.305
You haven't answered me.

09:54.985 --> 09:56.225
Who do you have a blind date with?

10:02.025 --> 10:02.865
Are…

10:04.305 --> 10:05.745
Are you jealous?

10:08.505 --> 10:09.585
You wish.

10:13.985 --> 10:15.225
My flatmate

10:15.745 --> 10:18.065
works in the marketing division
of a dating website.

10:18.865 --> 10:20.265
So I--

12:16.225 --> 12:17.585
<i>It was an accident.</i>

12:18.105 --> 12:19.785
<i>You had an accident, I know.</i>

12:19.865 --> 12:21.145
<i>But what about Luan Nian?</i>

12:21.225 --> 12:22.625
<i>Was he also an accident?</i>

12:23.545 --> 12:25.505
<i>First, he saved you,</i>

12:25.585 --> 12:27.265
<i>then, he created the happy accident.</i>

12:30.065 --> 12:34.145
The way I see it,
he has been playing the long game.

12:35.225 --> 12:36.705
<i>Date a few people.</i>

12:36.785 --> 12:38.345
Experiment a bit while you're young.

12:42.065 --> 12:44.345
<i>We only live for around 30,000 days.</i>

12:44.425 --> 12:45.705
<i>If you like someone, tell them.</i>

12:45.785 --> 12:47.305
<i>If you miss them, go see them.</i>

12:47.825 --> 12:49.465
As long as we're safe
and it's what we want,

12:49.545 --> 12:50.785
we have nothing to lose.

13:29.825 --> 13:30.905
If you want,

13:31.505 --> 13:33.545
we can keep our relationship private.

13:46.065 --> 13:46.905
You…

13:47.505 --> 13:49.225
You don't wear pajamas?

13:49.945 --> 13:50.985
You're wearing mine.

13:55.945 --> 13:57.385
I'll return them to you later.

13:58.265 --> 13:59.465
I want them now.

14:08.865 --> 14:10.145
I have to go home.

14:10.225 --> 14:11.625
I have work tomorrow.

14:17.425 --> 14:18.305
Sure.

14:19.505 --> 14:21.905
Let me call Mr. Liu. He'll drive you home.

14:21.985 --> 14:24.305
-Don't.
-Mr. Liu.

14:24.385 --> 14:26.465
Sorry for calling you this late.

14:26.545 --> 14:27.945
Can you send someone home for me?

14:28.665 --> 14:30.185
Yes, she's at my home.

14:40.425 --> 14:41.265
What?

14:46.505 --> 14:48.225
I don't want him to drive me back.

14:48.905 --> 14:50.185
He'll recognize me.

14:52.985 --> 14:54.345
So, what do you want?

14:57.705 --> 14:59.105
I'll sleep in the guest room.

15:01.505 --> 15:03.265
Planning to disappear tomorrow
without saying goodbye

15:03.865 --> 15:04.985
and just leave me a small note?

15:08.705 --> 15:10.425
I won't leave you a note this time.

15:12.505 --> 15:13.945
Last time, it was an accident.

15:15.505 --> 15:16.865
But this time, it's not.

15:19.745 --> 15:21.065
What is it then?

15:25.265 --> 15:26.465
I don't want to lose my job.

15:27.745 --> 15:29.425
I don't want to jeopardize my job either.

15:30.745 --> 15:32.905
I don't want others to think
I'm taking shortcuts

15:33.665 --> 15:34.505
by relying on you.

15:49.825 --> 15:51.265
I'll sleep in the guest room.

16:49.665 --> 16:51.025
You're making it more obvious.

16:52.585 --> 16:53.545
Can you

16:55.705 --> 16:57.465
drop me off at the subway?

16:59.825 --> 17:00.745
Eat first.

17:14.464 --> 17:16.704
You made this yourself?

17:16.785 --> 17:17.985
It's delicious.

17:40.545 --> 17:42.145
Can I have one more glass?

17:42.745 --> 17:43.705
Yes.

17:43.785 --> 17:44.745
Thank you.

18:25.985 --> 18:28.425
Just drop me off
at the subway entrance in front.

18:30.185 --> 18:32.385
JINTAI XIZHAO SUBWAY STATION

18:36.025 --> 18:36.865
We missed it.

18:38.025 --> 18:39.745
It's pouring. No need for the hassle.

18:53.825 --> 18:55.305
No one's around at this time.

18:55.825 --> 18:56.705
Just go up first.

19:27.905 --> 19:30.785
SHANG ZHITAO

19:33.625 --> 19:35.105
<i>Floor One.</i>

19:35.625 --> 19:37.385
Coming up from the parking lot?

19:37.465 --> 19:38.665
Did you buy a car?

19:38.745 --> 19:39.745
No.

19:39.825 --> 19:41.425
Sun Yu gave me a ride.

19:44.105 --> 19:46.185
Your friend is so much better
than my boyfriend.

19:46.265 --> 19:47.585
It's raining,
and my car is restricted today,

19:47.665 --> 19:49.105
and he didn't even offer
to give me a ride.

19:49.785 --> 19:52.065
Doesn't your boyfriend always pick you up?

19:52.145 --> 19:53.625
He's quite considerate.

19:53.705 --> 19:55.745
What's the point of having a boyfriend
if he's not considerate?

19:55.825 --> 19:57.985
I have to deal with a mean boss
with a weird temper

19:58.065 --> 19:59.665
at work already.

19:59.745 --> 20:01.185
Dealing with another one after work

20:01.265 --> 20:03.345
will make my life miserable.

20:07.545 --> 20:08.505
Where were you last night?

20:08.585 --> 20:09.865
You didn't even change your clothes.

20:13.225 --> 20:15.785
You're making it so obvious.

20:15.865 --> 20:17.585
It's not even a big deal. Just show it.

20:18.505 --> 20:22.265
Linda from Sales
always shows off her sexcapades.

20:25.145 --> 20:26.385
-Boss.
-Morning, Luke.

20:48.945 --> 20:51.065
Sun Yu is that good, huh?

20:51.145 --> 20:53.385
Was he as amazing as she said he was?

20:53.465 --> 20:54.785
Introduce him to me.

20:54.865 --> 20:56.745
-I'll gauge him for you.
-Enough…

20:56.825 --> 20:58.505
Stop guessing.

20:58.585 --> 20:59.785
My laptop is…

21:00.705 --> 21:01.545
What's wrong with your laptop?

21:02.945 --> 21:05.345
I left my laptop in Sun Yu's car.

21:06.025 --> 21:07.785
I need to call her
and ask her to bring it back.

21:07.865 --> 21:09.025
I'll go to Luke then.

21:09.105 --> 21:10.425
What for?

21:11.985 --> 21:14.585
I'll tell him
you didn't go home last night.

21:15.185 --> 21:17.225
Don't. What are you telling him?

21:17.305 --> 21:18.945
Why are you so scared?

21:19.025 --> 21:20.945
Are you traumatized by him or what?

21:21.025 --> 21:22.305
We'll be talking about the proposal.

21:22.905 --> 21:24.865
He couldn't care less
about the man you saw.

21:25.865 --> 21:29.385
Shouldn't you check with Alex
first about the proposal?

21:30.825 --> 21:31.665
Yikes.

21:31.745 --> 21:33.225
Thank you for the reminder.

21:33.305 --> 21:34.865
Otherwise, I would've been scolded.

21:34.945 --> 21:36.185
Alex comes in late.

21:36.265 --> 21:37.265
I'll get a cup of coffee.

21:37.345 --> 21:38.585
Do you want anything?

21:38.665 --> 21:40.665
No, thanks. Go. I'll make the call.

21:41.505 --> 21:42.945
Brandish it.

21:52.745 --> 21:53.785
Luke.

21:53.865 --> 21:56.225
I left my laptop bag in your car.

21:57.345 --> 21:58.625
<i>I'll bring it to you later.</i>

21:59.145 --> 21:59.985
No need.

22:00.065 --> 22:01.625
I'm at the parking lot.

22:01.705 --> 22:03.625
I'll find an empty place and wait for you.

22:15.505 --> 22:17.425
<i>Parking lot emergency exit.</i>

22:17.505 --> 22:18.665
<i>I'm there.</i>

22:18.745 --> 22:21.745
<i>When you come in, stomp your feet twice.</i>

22:54.545 --> 22:56.065
Even an arms smuggler
isn't as cautious as you.

22:59.105 --> 23:00.265
Thank you.

23:14.145 --> 23:15.185
What are you afraid of?

23:20.665 --> 23:21.985
I don't want people to see us.

23:22.705 --> 23:24.745
We must maintain a distance at work.

23:26.545 --> 23:28.545
And you maintain the distance
by inviting me

23:29.145 --> 23:30.505
to a dark staircase?

25:06.705 --> 25:07.625
<i>Shang Zhitao.</i>

25:09.705 --> 25:11.705
<i>Let's date in secret.</i>

25:20.905 --> 25:21.745
<i>Okay.</i>

25:31.065 --> 25:33.025
<i>But you can't tell anyone about us.</i>

25:37.185 --> 25:38.505
<i>Including your friends,</i>

25:40.105 --> 25:41.145
<i>your family…</i>

25:44.385 --> 25:45.305
<i>and your colleagues.</i>

25:48.265 --> 25:49.225
<i>Especially at the office.</i>

25:50.625 --> 25:53.065
<i>You are my superior,</i>
<i>and I am your subordinate.</i>

25:56.785 --> 25:57.745
<i>Fine with me.</i>

26:10.385 --> 26:12.345
<i>We'll remain exclusive to each other.</i>

26:13.385 --> 26:15.145
<i>I'll come see you every Friday.</i>

26:17.065 --> 26:19.185
<i>Okay. It's Friday today.</i>

26:19.265 --> 26:21.185
-<i>See you in a bit.</i>
-<i>See you in a bit.</i>

26:51.305 --> 26:52.905
THIRD FLOOR

27:10.945 --> 27:12.025
Hi, Mr. Luan.

27:12.105 --> 27:12.985
Hi, Mr. Luan.

27:22.505 --> 27:24.225
<i>During my second year in Lime,</i>

27:27.265 --> 27:32.705
<i>he and I started dating in secret.</i>

27:36.505 --> 27:40.905
<i>If coming to Beijing</i>
<i>is my first leap of faith,</i>

27:42.945 --> 27:46.225
<i>then this secret weekend relationship</i>

27:48.665 --> 27:51.025
<i>is my second leap of faith.</i>

27:53.985 --> 27:56.625
<i>This relationship makes me more mature,</i>

27:57.145 --> 27:58.385
<i>but it is also addictive.</i>

28:01.745 --> 28:04.145
SANYUAN BRIDGE

28:09.425 --> 28:12.865
BUSINESS DIVISION 2

28:26.625 --> 28:28.025
BANNER AD, CPI COST PER IMPRESSION

28:28.105 --> 28:29.505
PC PAY PER CLICK
IMC INTEGRATED MARKETING COMMUNICATIONS

28:48.265 --> 28:49.345
Luke.

28:50.065 --> 28:51.105
Let's go back together.

28:54.065 --> 28:55.745
But we must maintain a distance.

28:55.825 --> 28:57.665
I don't want people to see us.

28:59.465 --> 29:02.065
Just go first.
I haven't finished my report yet.

29:02.145 --> 29:03.385
It's raining.

29:03.905 --> 29:04.985
I'll drive you back.

29:05.065 --> 29:06.345
You can finish it at home.

29:41.705 --> 29:43.385
Eyes on the road.

29:48.745 --> 29:51.585
Does your cute flatmate
always come down to pick you up?

29:54.665 --> 29:55.505
Hmm?

29:57.985 --> 30:00.545
‎I…

30:00.625 --> 30:01.465
Not every day.

30:02.265 --> 30:06.585
He does that if I come home late
because the staircase is quite dark.

30:06.665 --> 30:09.025
And it's not just me.
He does that to others too.

30:09.105 --> 30:11.145
We help each other out.

30:27.585 --> 30:28.425
I'll walk you up.

30:28.505 --> 30:30.785
No need. I can just run there.

30:32.985 --> 30:34.345
I need to know your unit number.

30:34.865 --> 30:36.265
When you were drunk last time,

30:36.345 --> 30:37.785
I couldn't find your unit.

30:41.385 --> 30:42.425
Okay.

31:04.425 --> 31:05.985
I'm home.

31:06.065 --> 31:06.985
You can go back now.

31:11.025 --> 31:12.185
Your clothes are wet.

31:13.145 --> 31:14.305
I want to see you go inside.

31:19.185 --> 31:20.305
They are asleep.

31:20.385 --> 31:22.745
Let me see you off.

31:50.985 --> 31:54.545
WELCOME HOME

32:14.905 --> 32:15.785
Shang Zhitao.

32:18.425 --> 32:20.145
Your mascara is smeared.

32:25.465 --> 32:26.305
As agreed,

32:27.465 --> 32:28.385
see you on Friday.

32:37.985 --> 32:38.865
You're on my hair.

32:38.945 --> 32:40.465
Sorry. Hush.

32:56.665 --> 32:57.625
The board.

32:57.705 --> 32:58.625
Surprise!

32:58.705 --> 32:59.545
The board.

33:00.065 --> 33:01.625
Happy Birthday.

33:03.265 --> 33:04.985
SHANG ZHITAO, HAPPY BIRTHDAY

33:05.785 --> 33:06.905
Sun just came back.

33:06.985 --> 33:08.665
We want to make up for your birthday.

33:08.745 --> 33:10.065
Yes. Happy Birthday.

33:10.825 --> 33:12.665
Your nose. You got whipped cream on it.

33:14.465 --> 33:15.545
Oh my.

33:16.225 --> 33:17.945
I'll get the cutlery.

33:18.625 --> 33:19.465
Let me help you.

33:23.265 --> 33:25.185
Your mascara is smeared.

33:28.105 --> 33:29.665
Your boss drove you home.

33:33.265 --> 33:34.505
Let me look at the cake.

33:42.585 --> 33:45.265
LUMI

33:45.345 --> 33:46.225
Hello?

33:46.745 --> 33:49.385
<i>Luke. The logo inside Yueteng Auto Show</i>
<i>promotional pamphlets</i>

33:49.465 --> 33:51.105
<i>is misprinted.</i>

33:51.185 --> 33:53.625
<i>Fortunately, we found out in time.</i>
<i>We don't need to reprint everything.</i>

33:53.705 --> 33:56.505
<i>Tomorrow, I'll bring Flora with me</i>
<i>to deal with it in person.</i>

33:57.385 --> 33:58.665
The person in charge is Flora?

33:58.745 --> 33:59.585
<i>Yes.</i>

34:01.185 --> 34:02.865
Let's hear her solution for this first.

34:04.105 --> 34:05.425
Three days until the show.

34:05.945 --> 34:07.465
Let me reassure the client first.

34:07.985 --> 34:09.465
-<i>See you at the office.</i>
-Okay.

34:14.865 --> 34:17.304
SHANG ZHITAO

34:20.105 --> 34:22.465
LUAN NIAN

34:23.465 --> 34:25.425
Tao. Your phone is ringing.

34:25.505 --> 34:27.705
Pick it up for me. My hand is wet.

34:31.665 --> 34:33.065
<i>Hello?</i>

34:35.665 --> 34:37.025
I'm looking for Shang Zhitao.

34:37.105 --> 34:38.505
<i>Okay. Hold on.</i>

34:39.985 --> 34:42.465
<i>He sounds urgent. You should answer it.</i>

34:43.065 --> 34:44.665
Hi. Who's calling?

34:44.744 --> 34:45.705
<i>It's me.</i>

34:45.784 --> 34:48.304
The logo inside Yueteng Auto Show
promotional pamphlets is misprinted.

34:48.385 --> 34:50.425
<i>I'm on my way to your home.</i>

34:50.505 --> 34:51.665
<i>Come down in five minutes.</i>

34:51.744 --> 34:52.625
<i>We'll go back to the office.</i>

35:03.585 --> 35:05.705
YUETENG AUTO

35:07.665 --> 35:08.545
YUETENG AUTO

35:11.345 --> 35:12.545
Your overtime tonic is here.

35:13.145 --> 35:14.145
Coffee.

35:15.185 --> 35:16.465
Just go.

35:16.545 --> 35:18.025
I'll send it to your inbox
once I amend it.

35:18.825 --> 35:21.145
I'll stay with you.
You have to work overtime because of me.

35:21.225 --> 35:22.305
Who would have known

35:22.385 --> 35:25.225
that the client would ask us to change
the size and the logo at the last minute?

35:39.945 --> 35:41.745
I have amended it and sent it out.

35:41.825 --> 35:44.145
Okay. Thank you so much.

35:50.305 --> 35:51.785
<i>You got the client's logo wrong?</i>

35:51.865 --> 35:52.905
<i>How did you communicate</i>
<i>with the design team?</i>

35:53.585 --> 35:54.865
<i>Come up with a solution now.</i>

35:55.905 --> 35:56.905
What's the matter, Tao?

35:56.985 --> 35:58.305
I have to return to the office.

35:59.665 --> 36:00.505
Careful.

36:00.585 --> 36:02.305
TIANTONG DONGYUAN

36:10.985 --> 36:11.825
Luke.

36:12.745 --> 36:13.585
Sorry.

36:14.705 --> 36:16.425
I sent the wrong version.

36:17.025 --> 36:18.825
Tonight, I'll use our supplier database

36:18.905 --> 36:21.505
and find a supplier near the show venue

36:21.585 --> 36:23.825
to reprint the pages with the wrong logo.

36:23.905 --> 36:26.065
I can assure you that the problem
will be solved before the launch.

36:28.265 --> 36:30.425
Who sent the email?
You or the design team?

36:31.945 --> 36:33.465
I… It's me.

36:36.105 --> 36:37.385
I am the person in charge.

36:37.905 --> 36:39.665
I should be held accountable.

36:40.225 --> 36:41.705
I am willing to accept the punishment.

36:44.625 --> 36:45.465
Are you sure?

36:46.305 --> 36:47.145
Yes.

36:51.345 --> 36:52.265
Shang Zhitao.

36:53.305 --> 36:54.825
This is a grave error.

36:55.345 --> 36:56.225
According to the company policy,

36:56.305 --> 36:57.985
you will not be promoted
or receive a pay raise for a year.

36:58.945 --> 37:00.105
Are you sure about it?

37:16.545 --> 37:17.385
Okay.

37:20.705 --> 37:21.705
LIME SUPPLIERS LIST

37:21.785 --> 37:22.865
This…

37:23.705 --> 37:25.065
<i>Sorry for calling you this late.</i>

37:25.145 --> 37:27.265
<i>Sorry for the trouble.</i>

37:30.185 --> 37:31.545
YUETENG AUTO DC QUICK CHARGER

37:31.625 --> 37:32.585
PURE JOY, BOLD SPIRIT. YUETENG AUTO

38:04.105 --> 38:07.585
Well, I have a date
with my girlfriend tonight.

38:07.665 --> 38:08.705
I have to go now.

38:08.785 --> 38:10.385
Sure. Thank you.

38:46.505 --> 38:48.385
2013 BEIJING AUTO SHOW

38:49.105 --> 38:50.345
SHUNYI NEW VENUE

38:50.945 --> 38:52.385
YUETENG AUTO

38:54.105 --> 38:56.065
13TH BEIJING INTERNATIONAL
AUTOMOTIVE EXHIBITION

38:56.585 --> 39:00.185
BEIJING SUBWAY BATONG LINE
TONGZHOU BEIYUAN STATION

39:08.545 --> 39:13.065
Yueteng Auto Show was a success,

39:13.145 --> 39:15.185
but during the project,
a huge error occurred.

39:15.265 --> 39:17.225
The logo was misprinted.

39:18.425 --> 39:19.945
This is because

39:20.025 --> 39:22.345
I did not double-check
before sending it to the supplier.

39:23.225 --> 39:24.785
As the project manager,

39:24.865 --> 39:26.545
I take full responsibility.

39:26.625 --> 39:28.665
I accept any punishment from the company.

39:29.545 --> 39:31.265
But the situation was salvaged in the end.

39:32.825 --> 39:34.465
Flora worked very hard in this incident.

39:34.545 --> 39:38.505
She worked overnight for two days
to change the pages with the wrong logo.

39:41.705 --> 39:43.945
The client did not suffer any losses.

39:44.025 --> 39:45.225
That's right.

39:45.305 --> 39:47.225
No one is perfect.

39:47.745 --> 39:49.265
It's Flora's first time
as a project manager,

39:49.345 --> 39:50.385
and she handled it calmly.

39:50.465 --> 39:52.105
It's an achievement.

39:53.585 --> 39:54.865
If it involves our clients,
it's our priority.

39:54.945 --> 39:56.545
And never repeat this kind

39:57.545 --> 39:59.105
of simple mistake again.

39:59.785 --> 40:01.985
But Flora did come up
with a solution in time

40:02.065 --> 40:03.985
to salvage the whole situation.

40:04.065 --> 40:05.065
I'll tell Tracy

40:05.585 --> 40:07.905
that, as a punishment,
she will not be promoted

40:07.985 --> 40:09.465
or get a raise within six months.

40:11.025 --> 40:12.585
Her bonus for this quarter will be halved.

40:13.985 --> 40:14.945
Dismissed.

40:26.265 --> 40:28.065
You didn't cause any losses.

40:28.145 --> 40:29.505
Why did he punish you?

40:31.665 --> 40:32.545
Tao.

40:32.625 --> 40:33.785
Cheer up.

40:33.865 --> 40:35.145
He's just giving you a warning.

40:35.225 --> 40:37.345
You will have your bonus.

40:37.425 --> 40:38.425
It's not about the bonus.

40:41.425 --> 40:43.625
That means you're taking it to heart.

40:44.305 --> 40:47.105
You think he's cold and heartless.

40:50.585 --> 40:53.785
To settle this matter, Luke
reassured the client in person.

40:54.385 --> 40:57.105
He also approved the budget
for reprinting personally.

40:58.545 --> 41:00.065
This is his leadership style.

41:00.145 --> 41:01.905
He holds us to a high standard,

41:01.985 --> 41:04.265
but he still protects us.

41:05.385 --> 41:06.865
Don't take it to heart.

41:06.945 --> 41:07.945
Lumi.

41:11.825 --> 41:14.225
Thank you for helping me clear this mess.

41:15.225 --> 41:16.865
Thank you for defending me.

41:17.745 --> 41:21.185
Thank you for consoling me.

41:23.425 --> 41:24.505
You want to thank me?

41:26.585 --> 41:27.705
Smile for me.

41:31.905 --> 41:33.105
Smile properly.

41:45.705 --> 41:47.065
Tao, you're back.

41:47.985 --> 41:48.945
You haven't eaten, have you?

41:49.025 --> 41:52.025
Lei made seafood fried rice today.

41:52.105 --> 41:53.225
I saved a bowl for you.

41:54.425 --> 41:55.545
Come eat.

41:57.505 --> 41:58.825
You didn't come home for two days.

41:58.905 --> 42:00.345
You must be tired.

42:05.425 --> 42:07.625
Lei's cooking is still as good as usual.

42:09.585 --> 42:10.865
It's all your favorites.

42:12.705 --> 42:13.905
You're so nice to me.

42:13.985 --> 42:15.305
Of course.

42:15.385 --> 42:16.745
Why wouldn't I?

42:22.425 --> 42:24.225
-It's so good.
-Right?

42:24.305 --> 42:25.465
I had two bowls.

42:27.985 --> 42:29.545
All good at work?

42:31.305 --> 42:32.425
Yes.

42:32.505 --> 42:33.785
I knew you could do it.

42:33.865 --> 42:35.425
Good. I'm glad it's settled.

42:35.505 --> 42:36.345
Eat.

42:36.865 --> 42:39.865
But I won't be promoted for six months.

42:41.425 --> 42:42.345
Six months?

42:42.945 --> 42:44.345
Seriously?

42:44.425 --> 42:45.825
That's way too harsh of him.

42:46.425 --> 42:49.505
Even if he wasn't your boyfriend,
as a boss, that was so cruel.

42:51.145 --> 42:53.145
I did make a mistake.

42:54.065 --> 42:56.625
It's just that I don't know if I'm upset

42:57.145 --> 43:01.745
because he scolded me as my boss

43:01.825 --> 43:06.745
or because he didn't give me
any special treatment.

43:16.745 --> 43:17.985
But if he did

43:19.025 --> 43:22.945
give me any special treatment
and show favoritism,

43:23.025 --> 43:24.985
it wouldn't be what I wanted.

43:27.425 --> 43:28.865
But he…

43:29.585 --> 43:31.985
I know you're someone
who knows what's what.

43:32.945 --> 43:34.425
But we are emotional creatures.

43:34.505 --> 43:36.425
It's fine if we can't be
completely rational.

43:36.505 --> 43:38.145
Don't be so harsh on yourself.

43:44.345 --> 43:45.425
Crybaby.

43:48.465 --> 43:50.425
Maybe I'm just too weak.

43:51.625 --> 43:52.665
I hope

43:53.185 --> 43:55.465
I can be stronger.

43:58.105 --> 44:00.025
Just like him.

44:00.105 --> 44:02.785
That way, we can communicate
on equal footing

44:02.865 --> 44:04.265
and keep work and personal life separate.

44:05.505 --> 44:09.465
So how strong do you have to be
to realize that in the relationship?

44:10.305 --> 44:11.305
I don't know.

44:11.945 --> 44:15.625
I hope I can improve
a little bit every day.

44:19.465 --> 44:20.625
All right.

44:21.585 --> 44:22.905
Don't dwell on it.

44:22.985 --> 44:24.105
Just sleep.

44:24.185 --> 44:25.225
Tomorrow is a new day.

44:29.305 --> 44:30.585
Eat slowly.

44:31.745 --> 44:32.865
Your hair.

44:58.785 --> 45:00.745
<i>As the project manager,</i>

45:00.825 --> 45:02.145
<i>I take full responsibility.</i>

45:02.225 --> 45:03.945
<i>I accept any punishment from the company.</i>

45:07.185 --> 45:09.785
YOU GOT THE CLIENT'S LOGO WRONG?

45:09.865 --> 45:10.905
HOW DID YOU COMMUNICATE
WITH THE DESIGN TEAM?

45:10.985 --> 45:12.065
COME UP WITH A SOLUTION NOW

45:18.345 --> 45:22.145
<i>To settle this matter,</i>
<i>Luke reassured the client in person.</i>

45:22.225 --> 45:24.945
<i>He also approved</i>
<i>the budget for reprinting personally.</i>

45:25.025 --> 45:26.585
This is his leadership style.

45:26.665 --> 45:28.025
He holds us to a high standard,

45:28.105 --> 45:30.985
<i>but he still protects us.</i>

45:33.425 --> 45:36.625
THANK YOU

45:43.225 --> 45:46.185
ACTUALLY, I…

46:17.105 --> 46:18.025
Hello?

46:18.825 --> 46:19.705
Where are you?
